      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://movewhereusa.com/towns/sandy-hook-wi/"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The name Sandy Hook comes from the deep sand deposits left along the water in Grant County.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://movewhereusa.com/towns/sandy-hook-wi/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Lead miners first put down roots in these hills during the 1820s, long before the area became a river hamlet.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
