      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://movewhereusa.com/towns/sandy-hook-wi/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Lock and Dam 11 and the O’Leary’s Lake area offer fishing, boat launches, and wide river views in Sandy Hook.",
